(846, 1464, 'reply', 'reply:event:1464', 'Suitable options for your group (subject to staff approval):\n1. 5-guest room (up to 5 guests) — PHP 5,000.00 / night\n2. 8-guest room (up to 8 guests) — PHP 8,000.00 / night\n3. 9-guest room (up to 9 guests) — PHP 9,000.00 / night\n\nWant to book? Reply once with:\n\n🕒 Check-in and check-out times — e.g. 2 PM and 11 AM\n🏠 Option number\n👤 Full name\n📞 Mobile number or email\n\nExample: Check in 2 PM, check out 11 AM, Option 1, Maria Santos, 09171234567\n\nAutomated reply • Reply ADMIN for staff assistance.', 'succeeded', 1, 5, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-15 05:43:38', '2026-09-15 05:43:39'),
